  "body": "## Bathcat ready-for-audit packet\n\n- Candidate: Elder Sign (BGG 100423), Fantasy Flight Games base game\n- Scope: core box and official Rules of Play only; expansions and digital adaptation excluded\n- Cohort: cooperative\n- Packet: `intake/runs/2026-08-02-elder-sign/`\n- Status: ready_for_audit; no approval or promotion included\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Official rules: Fantasy Flight CDN PDF, retrieved HTTP 200\n- Independent reception: Geek and Sundry TableTop episode on YouTube, retrieved HTTP 200\n- Visuals: two reduced source-linked references with hashes\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node --test scripts/intake-lib.test.mjs scripts/validate-intake-package.test.mjs scripts/fail-closed.test.mjs scripts/validate-okf-provenance.test.mjs`\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --base origin/main`\n- `node scripts/validate-okf.mjs` on the staged canonical records\n\nThe Mennonite must independently reopen the sources, verify the video timestamps and visual rights basis, bind approval to the immutable packet hash, and perform promotion if approved. Bathcat will not approve or merge.",
